This package is an experiment shell for NOvA ND JAX simulation and calibration. It
depends on (and does not vendor) shared generators and libraries:

- BdNMC / bdnmc-jax (RobMina/BdNMC)
- ldmgen (https://github.com/RobMina/ldmgen)
- bdnmc-nova (RobMina/bdnmc-nova) — HEPEVT / TextFileGen file writers and UVA two-stage jobs
- hep-simlib / hep-simbench / hep-endpoints / cryjax (as those land in the NOvA track)

NOvASoft TextFileGen is stock collaboration software; this repository orchestrates
jobs that call it and does not reimplement it.

NOvA-internal inputs (geometry, FCLs, conditions, calibration tables, data results)
are not part of this repository. They belong in the separate private bundle
nova-fastsim-inputs when that exists (see setup/README.md).

Optional runtime dependencies (not vendored): RobMina/bdnmc-nova, RobMina/hep-simbench,
and ldmgen when published.
